# Spelunking: "draw a card, then you may put a land card from your hand onto the battlefield" (CR 608.2c: in the order
# written). Bot1's hand holds no land; the trigger draws Promising Vein (a Cave), which is then in the hand to be put: Bot1
# puts it and gains 4 life (20 -> 24). Were the land chosen before the draw, there would be none to choose.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Spelunking
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Promising Vein
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Spelunking.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Promising Vein)
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 24
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Emerald; Mox Jet; Mox Ruby; Spelunking; Promising Vein
Bot1.Hand = Lightning Bolt; Lightning Bolt; Lightning Bolt
